<title>JAPAN: Nabco - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nabco - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 32.70		vs	   31.92</p>
<p> Operating	  629 million	 vs	    1.14</p>
<p> Current	    450 million	 vs	  840 million</p>
<p> Net		  374 million	 vs	  773 million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.48 yen	  vs	    9.27 yen</p>
<p> Shares		83 million	 vs	   83 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nabco Ltd is maker of brakes for cars and railway rolling stock.</p>
